### LBR Book Service API Tests
### Base URL: http://localhost:5025

### Health Check - Basic
GET http://localhost:5025/api/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Health Check - Detailed Info
GET http://localhost:5025/api/health/info
Accept: application/json

###

### Test 404 - Non-existent endpoint
GET http://localhost:5025/api/nonexistent
Accept: application/json

###

